# Base mainnet RPC endpoint used by Guardian's on-chain reads.
# The public default (https://mainnet.base.org) works but rate-limits aggressively,
# which makes the ~30-day Approval log scan slow or flaky.
#
# A dedicated key (Alchemy / Infura / QuickNode) is STRONGLY recommended — it makes
# approval scans fast and reliable. Copy this file to .env.local and paste your URL.
NEXT_PUBLIC_BASE_RPC_URL=https://mainnet.base.org
